    "body": "Seeking Concept ACK \n\nThis adds a note on `doc/developer-notes.md` clarifying how should be the description when a test is added or extended to kill mutants. The main motivation is to facilitate review, avoid duplicated work (different PRs addressing the same mutants), and go towards an automated setup to check it.",
